---
---
<section class="section sapote" id="sapote">
  <div class="section__inner">
    <div class="split split--reverse">

      <div class="split__image">
        <div class="split__image-box">
          <img src="/images/drone-jungle.jpg" alt="Aerial view of Casa Arkaana deep in the Tulum jungle" loading="lazy">
          <div class="split__image-label">The Sapote Tree · Casa Arkaana</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split__text">
        <span class="eyebrow">The Heart of the Property</span>
        <span class="gold-line"></span>
        <h2 class="split__heading">Under the <em class="gold">Sapote Tree.</em></h2>
        <p class="split__body">
          There is a tree on this land that has stood for generations. Its canopy fills the ceremony space. Couples exchange vows beneath it. It holds everything.
        </p>
        <p class="split__body">
          You can't book a tree like this anywhere else. That's the point.
        </p>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">Tell Us Your Vision</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .sapote {
    background: var(--color-cream);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .split--reverse {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-6);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .split--reverse .split__image { order: -1; }

  .split__image-box {
    background: var(--color-bg);
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .split__image-box img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .split__image-label {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: var(--sp-3);
    left: var(--sp-3);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  }

  .split__heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-3);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .split__heading em { font-style: italic; }
  .split__heading .gold { color: var(--color-gold); }

  .split__body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .split--reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 55fr 45fr;
      gap: var(--sp-8);
    }

    .split--reverse .split__image { order: 0; }
    .split--reverse .split__text { order: -1; }

    .split__image-box {
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1200px) {
    .split--reverse {
      gap: var(--sp-15);
    }

    .split__image-box {
      aspect-ratio: unset;
      min-height: 560px;
    }
  }
</style>
